      "message": "As mentioned somewhere (likely an email), it is rather arbitrary.\nIt has to be guaranteed to be longer than the worst case time for the CR50 to reassert EC reset, that it is the only criterion.\n2 seconds seemed just as good as any other, and making it shorter doesn\u0027t buy us anything (as mentioned before, if the CR50 doesn\u0027t assert the reset, then having a 2 second delay on the EC is the least of our worries).",
